---
import "../Style/global.css";

import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Card from "../components/Card.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
    <title>RÅDGIVNINGEN ORFEUS</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <Header headline="RÅDGIVNINGEN ORFEUS"/>
    <section>
      <h2>Her kunne der være nogle cards</h2>
      <div class="cards">
        <Card headline="Check det ud" text="Der er nok vigtigt" />
        <Card headline="Her er også noget spændende" text="Med mere tekst" />
        <Card headline="Lidt ekstra" text="Som bestemt er vigtigt" />
      </div>
    </section>
   
    <section>
      <h2>Her kunne der være noget tekst</h2>
      <p>Selvom folk ikke læser det</p>
      <div class="two-columns">
        <p>Lorem, ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Porro, unde inventore exercitationem ipsum nobis atque laudantium molestiae ratione accusantium architecto est corrupti ab at, doloribus necessitatibus ea odio deserunt natus!</p>
        <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit, amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Esse explicabo facere quo rem, aliquam sint consequuntur quod itaque dolores voluptatibus vitae minus commodi delectus odit labore eum error fugiat architecto.</p>
		<p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Ad iusto pariatur sint totam voluptatum optio accusamus cumque, illum dignissimos id! Accusantium tempore reiciendis exercitationem, commodi delectus laudantium consectetur rem voluptatibus?</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  section {
    padding: 10%;
  }

  .cards {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2rem;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(250px, 1fr));
    padding-top: 2rem;
  }

  .two-columns {
    padding-top: 2rem;
	column-count: 2;
  }
</style>
